---

<div class="wa-widget" id="waWidget">
  <div class="wa-card" id="waCard">
    <div class="wa-card-header">
      <div class="wa-card-brand">
        <span class="r-mark sm"></span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="wa-card-name">PrimeNest Digitals</div>
        <div class="wa-card-status"><span class="wa-status-dot"></span>Typically replies within hours</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="wa-close" id="waClose" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
    <p class="wa-card-msg"><strong>Hi there.</strong> I am Hazeem. Got a question about growing your business or want to know if we are the right fit? Message me directly — no bots, no account managers. Just me.</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/13653751409?text=Hi%20Hazeem%2C%20I%20found%20PrimeNest%20Digitals%20and%20I%27d%20like%20to%20grow%20my%20business." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="wa-card-cta">
